  <header><span class="num">01</span><span class="sev sev-high">High</span><h3>The moment after a printer is added is left to the model, and it changed every run</h3></header>
  <div class="body">
    <p class="lead">Same input, three runs, three different scripts. Run A: “creality k1” was saved at once and the reply ended with no offer to connect; the offer only appeared later, after I changed the nozzle. Run B: “Prusa MK4S” chosen from a chip was saved at once and nothing was offered at all. Run C (dark theme): the printer was saved and the offer came as bare “Yes / No” chips.</p>
